ercase tracking-widest\">soundcore Anker </span></div><h1 class=\"text-3xl md:text-5xl lg:text-6xl font-black leading-tight mb-6 max-w-4xl tracking-tight\">soundcore Anker P20i True Wireless Earbuds Review</h1><div class=\"flex flex-wrap items-center gap-4 text-purple-100 font-medium\"><div class=\"flex items-center gap-1 bg-white/10 px-3 py-1.5 rounded-lg border border-white/10\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"lucide lucide-star w-4 h-4 text-amber-400 fill-amber-400\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path d=\"M11.525 2.295a.53.53 0 0 1 .95 0l2.31 4.679a2.123 2.123 0 0 0 1.595 1.16l5.166.756a.53.53 0 0 1 .294.904l-3.736 3.638a2.123 2.123 0 0 0-.611 1.878l.882 5.14a.53.53 0 0 1-.771.56l-4.618-2.428a2.122 2.122 0 0 0-1.973 0L6.396 21.01a.53.53 0 0 1-.77-.56l.881-5.139a2.122 2.122 0 0 0-.611-1.879L2.16 9.795a.53.53 0 0 1 .294-.906l5.165-.755a2.122 2.122 0 0 0 1.597-1.16z\"></path></svg><span class=\"text-white font-bold\">4.2</span><span class=\"text-sm opacity-70\">/ 5</span></div><div class=\"flex items-center gap-1 px-3 py-1.5\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"lucide lucide-tag w-4 h-4 text-amber-300\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path d=\"M12.586 2.586A2 2 0 0 0 11.172 2H4a2 2 0 0 0-2 2v7.172a2 2 0 0 0 .586 1.414l8.704 8.704a2.426 2.426 0 0 0 3.42 0l6.58-6.58a2.426 2.426 0 0 0 0-3.42z\"></path><circle cx=\"7.5\" cy=\"7.5\" r=\".5\" fill=\"currentColor\"></circle></svg><span>Budget<!-- --> Tier</span></div></div></div></div><div class=\"container mx-auto max-w-7xl px-4 -mt-20 relative z-20\"><div class=\"grid grid-cols-1 lg:grid-cols-12 gap-8\"><div class=\"lg:col-span-8 space-y-8\"><div class=\"bg-white rounded-3xl p-8 shadow-xl border border-slate-100 flex items-center justify-center relative overflow-hidden group\"><div class=\"w-full h-75 md:h-125 p-8 flex items-center justify-center relative\"><img alt=\"soundcore Anker P20i True Wireless Earbuds Review\" decoding=\"async\" data-nimg=\"fill\" class=\"object-contain group-hover:scale-[1.02] transition-transform duration-500\" style=\"position:absolute;height:100%;width:100%;left:0;top:0;right:0;bottom:0;color:transparent\" src=\"https://cdn.sanity.io/images/kxdjzy8e/production/886d391c1a9caa3f5e86a80fc81de8f9d73cd1b2-1251x1500.jpg\"/></div><div class=\"absolute top-0 right-0 bg-linear-to-bl from-amber-400 to-orange-500 text-white px-6 py-2 rounded-bl-3xl font-bold shadow-lg z-10\">Editor&#x27;s Review</div></div><div class=\"grid grid-cols-1 md:grid-cols-2 gap-6\"><div class=\"bg-emerald-50/50 rounded-2xl p-6 border border-emerald-100\"><h3 class=\"font-bold text-emerald-900 mb-4 flex items-center gap-2\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"lucide lucide-circle-check w-5 h-5 text-emerald-600\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><circle cx=\"12\" cy=\"12\" r=\"10\"></circle><path d=\"m9 12 2 2 4-4\"></path></svg> The Good</h3><ul class=\"space-y-3\"><li class=\"flex items-start gap-2 text-base text-emerald-900/80\"><span class=\"mt-1.5 w-1.5 h-1.5 rounded-full bg-emerald-500 shrink-0\"></span>Incredible price point</li><li class=\"flex items-start gap-2 text-base text-emerald-900/80\"><span class=\"mt-1.5 w-1.5 h-1.5 rounded-full bg-emerald-500 shrink-0\"></span>&quot;Find My Earbuds&quot; feature</li><li class=\"flex items-start gap-2 text-base text-emerald-900/80\"><span class=\"mt-1.5 w-1.5 h-1.5 rounded-full bg-emerald-500 shrink-0\"></span>Compact case with lanyard</li><li class=\"flex items-start gap-2 text-base text-emerald-900/80\"><span class=\"mt-1.5 w-1.5 h-1.5 rounded-full bg-emerald-500 shrink-0\"></span>Punchy bass for the size</li></ul></div><div class=\"bg-rose-50/50 rounded-2xl p-6 border border-rose-100\"><h3 class=\"font-bold text-rose-900 mb-4 flex items-center gap-2\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"lucide lucide-circle-x w-5 h-5 text-rose-500\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><circle cx=\"12\" cy=\"12\" r=\"10\"></circle><path d=\"m15 9-6 6\"></path><path d=\"m9 9 6 6\"></path></svg> Watch Out</h3><ul class=\"space-y-3\"><li class=\"flex items-start gap-2 text-base text-rose-900/80\"><span class=\"mt-1.5 w-1.5 h-1.5 rounded-full bg-rose-400 shrink-0\"></span>No Active Noise Cancellation (ANC)</li><li class=\"flex items-start gap-2 text-base text-rose-900/80\"><span class=\"mt-1.5 w-1.5 h-1.5 rounded-full bg-rose-400 shrink-0\"></span>Microphone struggles in wind</li><li class=\"flex items-start gap-2 text-base text-rose-900/80\"><span class=\"mt-1.5 w-1.5 h-1.5 rounded-full bg-rose-400 shrink-0\"></span>Plastic build feels cheap</li></ul></div></div><div class=\"bg-white rounded-3xl p-8 shadow-sm border border-slate-100\"><h2 class=\"text-2xl font-bold text-slate-900 mb-6 pb-4 border-b border-slate-100\">In-Depth Review</h2><div class=\"prose prose-slate prose-lg max-w-none\"><p class=\"mb-6 leading-relaxed text-gray-900 text-base\">The Soundcore P20i dominates the UAE market because it offers features usually reserved for AED 200+ earbuds. The companion app allows you to customize the EQ (a rarity at this price), and the &quot;Game Mode&quot; reduces latency. While the call quality is passable for indoor use, don&#x27;t expect crystal clear calls on a windy Dubai street.</p></div></div><div class=\"mb-4 p-4 bg-slate-100 rounded-xl border border-slate-300 border-l-4 border-l-slate-600 mt-8\"><div class=\"flex items-center gap-2 mb-1\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"lucide lucide-info w-3 h-3 text-[#4b0082]\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><circle cx=\"12\" cy=\"12\" r=\"10\"></circle><path d=\"M12 16v-4\"></path><path d=\"M12 8h.01\"></path></svg><h3 class=\"text-sm font-bold text-[#4b0082] uppercase tracking-widest\">Why we picked this</h3></div><p class=\"text-sm text-slate-900 font-semibold leading-relaxed italic\">&quot;<!-- -->The undisputed king of budget earbuds in the UAE. For under AED 70, you get app support, decent bass, and a lanyard-equipped case. Perfect for daily commuting if you don&#x27;t want to risk expensive gear.<!-- -->&quot;</p></div></div><div class=\"lg:col-span-4 space-y-6\"><div class=\"hidden lg:block bg-white rounded-3xl p-6 shadow-xl border border-slate-200 sticky top-24 z-30\"><div class=\"text-center mb-6\"><span class=\"text-sm font-bold text-slate-400 uppercase tracking-widest block mb-2\">Best Price Found</span><div class=\"flex items-center justify-center gap-1\"><span class=\"text-lg font-medium text-slate-500 mb-1\">AED</span><span class=\"text-5xl font-black text-slate-900 tracking-tight\">59</span></div><div class=\"inline-block bg-green-100 text-green-800 text-[11px] font-bold px-3 py-1 rounded-full mt-3\">IN STOCK</div></div><a href=\"https://amzn.to/48QApU3\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow sponsored noopener\" class=\"group flex items-center justify-center gap-2 w-full bg-[#0071e3] hover:bg-[#0076df] text-white font-bold py-4 px-6 rounded-xl shadow-lg shadow-blue-200 transition-all hover:-translate-y-1 hover:shadow-xl text-lg mb-4\">View on <!-- -->Amazon.ae<svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"lucide lucide-external-link w-5 h-5 opacity-80\" aria-hidden=\"tru